    {
     "t": "event-field",
     "field": "title",
     "text": "Hashables, Rezzy, Zzzonked Pop-Up",
     "level": 1
    },
    {
     "t": "event-field",
     "field": "datetime",
     "text": "June 8, 2024\n@ 2:00 pm\n- 5:00 pm"
    },
    {
     "t": "image",
     "ref": "assets/source/7e3bb837-nova-farms-brand-pop-up-logo_200px.png",
     "srcUrl": "https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/nova-farms-brand-pop-up-logo_200px.png?lossy=2&strip=0&webp=1",
     "alt": "Rezzy, Zzzonked, Hashable Pop-Up Event",
     "w": 200,
     "h": 200,
     "kind": "event-image"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><strong>Learn more about Rezzy, Zzzonked and Hashables brands and enjoy some of their non-infused samples.</strong></p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Rezzy"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Infused with Live Resin from fresh-frozen flower, Rezzy products are full-spectrum, creating an entourage effect rivalling top-tier flower. A little goes a long way; with Rezzy you’ll experience that full bodied glow and perma smile every time.</p><p>Rezzy is fast-acting, refreshing, and packed with natural sweetness, making it extra delicious.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Zzzonked"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Sleep like a log tonight with Zzzonked Edibles, the super sedating collection of gummies, chocolates, and tinctures. Made with a natural blend of melatonin and full-spectrum cannabinoids: CBN, CBD, and THC, it’s the perfect recipe for a good night’s sleep.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Hashables"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Hashables, a synergy of hash rosin and scintillating flavor. Zap yourself into a new dimension with these full-spectrum hash-infused edibles! Formulated with solventless hash rosin and natural flavors, the effects of these edibles are potent and full-bodied. So leave it to the solventless extract experts and discover New England’s own Hashables.</p><p><a href=\"/brands/rezzy-2/\"><strong>Click here to shop Rezzy products!</strong></a></p><p><a href=\"/brands/zzzonked/\"><strong>Click here to shop Zzzonked products!</strong></a></p><p><a href=\"/brands/hashables/\"><strong>Click here to shop Hashables products!</strong></a></p>"
    },
    {
